claim.claim-text:
an outer section (310) having substantially hollow interior;
an inner section (305) configured to be stowed within the substantially hollow interior of the outer section (310) in a first configuration;
a telescoping means for extending the outer section (310) along a length of the inner section (305) to increase a wingspan in a second configuration; and
a control surface attached to a trailing-edge of the outer section (310), wherein the control surface attaches to the outer section (310) via a hinge (1215) mounted on an external surface of the trailing-edge.
